{"sections":[{"slug":"弱n-范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"弱n-范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">弱</span> n-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“弱 n-范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">也许不应该组合地寻找弱</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是从同伦型出发</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦假设","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦假设</span>"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴概念的失败</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">错误的论文</span>: Kapranov &amp; Voevodsky <em>$\\infty$-groupoids and homotopy types</em></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">反例</span> (Carlos Simpson, <em>Homotopy types of strict $3$-groupoids</em>): $\\pi_{\\leq  3}(S^2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">不等价于严格</span> $3$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">科普</span>: A whrilwind tour</p>\n<p>Simpson, Homotopy Theory of Higher Categories (<span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Segal范畴","text":"Segal <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n"}]}}}]}